<title>INDIA: India says to prepare for rupee convertibility.</title>
<headline>India says to prepare for rupee convertibility.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian Finance Minister P. Chidambaram said on Friday that the time had come to prepare for making the rupee convertible on the capital account.</p>
<p>&quot;I also believe that the time has come for preparatory work towards capital account convertibility,&quot; Chidambaram said while presenting the budget for 1997/98 (April-March).  </p>
<p>Chidambaram said the government was asking the Reserve Bank of India to set up a panel of experts to pave the way towards making the rupee convertible on capital account.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
